Every machine in the world is Little Endian, and I'm going to specify a file format -- https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WAV -- with C structs and type punning.  Seriously, Microsoft?
Me, I just
  static uint32_t
  load32_le(const uint8_t s[8])
  {
      return (uint32_t)s[0]
          | ((uint32_t)s[1] <<  8)
          | ((uint32_t)s[2] << 16)
          | ((uint32_t)s[3] << 24);
  }
